# GitHub Linguist Overrides
# Ensure repository displays 100% JavaScript (React JS frontend + Node.js/Express.js backend)
*.html linguist-detectable=false
*.html linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-detectable=false
*.json linguist-vendored
*.md linguist-detectable=false
*.md linguist-vendored
*.sql linguist-detectable=false
*.sql linguist-vendored
